table, so they are logically equivalent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d3248ef5-ad73-59c1-88f3-d69d0a99470f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d3248ef5-ad73-59c1-88f3-d69d0a99470f" :answer-field/id #uuid "d3248ef5-ad73-59c1-88f3-d69d0a99470f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-38c2d5e6-6875-5213-b536-37798ae375d2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-38c2d5e6-6875-5213-b536-37798ae375d2" "answer-6587714c-9457-568c-ac05-8ad90932e8b1" "answer-ac4a9d6e-1837-5aae-a498-e4bc74af3170" "answer-3c3a15f1-ad3b-58b1-bc06-3283dca42c42" "answer-8f86c8f5-dc50-5d32-87f9-bb0bad663aaf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-38c2d5e6-6875-5213-b536-37798ae375d2" :answer/id #uuid "38c2d5e6-6875-5213-b536-37798ae375d2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6587714c-9457-568c-ac05-8ad90932e8b1" :answer/id #uuid "6587714c-9457-568c-ac05-8ad90932e8b1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac4a9d6e-1837-5aae-a498-e4bc74af3170" :answer/id #uuid "ac4a9d6e-1837-5aae-a498-e4bc74af3170" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3c3a15f1-ad3b-58b1-bc06-3283dca42c42" :answer/id #uuid "3c3a15f1-ad3b-58b1-bc06-3283dca42c42" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8f86c8f5-dc50-5d32-87f9-bb0bad663aaf" :answer/id #uuid "8f86c8f5-dc50-5d32-87f9-bb0bad663aaf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of those listed" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186157230 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-31ca1a18-e271-54de-8d6a-f0aa14857b82"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186157632 :question/problem "Find the missing values in the following truth table:" :question/worked-solution "First, let's solve for the missing values:\n\n- When $A≡\\text{T}$ and $B≡\\text{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬A∨¬B & ≡¬\\text{T}∨¬\\text{T} \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}∨\\text{F} \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- When $A≡\\text{T}$ and $B≡\\text{F},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬A∨¬B & ≡¬\\text{T}∨¬\\text{F} \\\\  & ≡\\text{F}∨\\text{T} \\\\  & ≡\\text{T}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- When $A≡\\text{F}$ and $B≡\\text{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬(A∧B) & ≡¬(\\text{F}∧\\text{T}) \\\\  & ≡¬\\text{F} \\\\  & ≡\\text{T}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOur completed table is shown below.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬(A∧B)\\,$ | $\\,¬A∨¬B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nTo determine whether $¬(A∧B)$ is logically equivalent to $¬A∨¬B,$ we need to check whether their truth tables are equivalent.\n\nLooking at the last two columns, we see that they are the same $(\\text{F},\\text{T},\\text{T},\\text{T}).$ Therefore, we conclude that \n\n$$\n¬(A∧B)≡¬A∨¬B.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-427549ac-c517-584c-833b-e3067bc01788" "answer-field-149af20b-492b-566d-9400-bf00e13bfd30" "answer-field-ce54b23b-99a2-54a1-b4c2-0560201db0dd" "answer-field-70cb2a41-cfff-576e-90ca-abdb122477cf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-427549ac-c517-584c-833b-e3067bc01788" :answer-field/id #uuid "427549ac-c517-584c-833b-e3067bc01788" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-d07a632f-a215-52fb-8b7e-a1ce0e990b52" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d07a632f-a215-52fb-8b7e-a1ce0e990b52" "answer-1fd808a4-c11b-550d-9ea2-7d4cd9978ac5"] 