$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for $B∨(¬A∧¬B):$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬A\\,$ | $\\,¬B\\,$ | $\\,¬A∧¬B\\,$ | $\\,B∨(¬A∧¬B)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9a6c325b-07f0-5590-9158-3fe20884a4d5" "answer-field-8829a292-4914-5cab-a172-ada11c4230e6" "answer-field-9bff55b8-03cc-51ab-8182-0f38a2d6283b" "answer-field-335db4d0-e78a-5086-8228-fb291ff6c553"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9a6c325b-07f0-5590-9158-3fe20884a4d5" :answer-field/id #uuid "9a6c325b-07f0-5590-9158-3fe20884a4d5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-5eec7b4c-36e1-5fcd-ae1d-58cd983cebe3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3b3dc4c9-2fb8-5da7-8957-00adbd0b7707" "answer-5eec7b4c-36e1-5fcd-ae1d-58cd983cebe3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3b3dc4c9-2fb8-5da7-8957-00adbd0b7707" :answer/id #uuid "3b3dc4c9-2fb8-5da7-8957-00adbd0b7707" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5eec7b4c-36e1-5fcd-ae1d-58cd983cebe3" :answer/id #uuid "5eec7b4c-36e1-5fcd-ae1d-58cd983cebe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8829a292-4914-5cab-a172-ada11c4230e6" :answer-field/id #uuid "8829a292-4914-5cab-a172-ada11c4230e6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-0150989f-9b6c-5f03-9a0b-cccc272d99